        "image": null,
        "markdown": "\n\n### Pain Point\n\n> \"One role needs to go on LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor, and our website\\. Each channel has a different format\\. Plus it needs Italian and English versions\\. Every time I spend half an hour reformatting\\.\"\n> \n> \n\n\n### Steps\n\n1. **Prepare the role info**\nTell the AI the following elements:\n\n    |    Element|    Description|    Example|\n    |---|---|---|\n    |    Role name|    In English and local language|    Senior Merchandiser|\n    |    Level|    Junior / Mid / Senior|    Senior|\n    |    Core responsibilities|    3\\-5 items|    Merchandise planning, SKU analysis, seasonal buying plan|\n    |    Requirements|    Hard requirements|    5\\+ years fashion industry, fluent Italian and English|\n    |    Nice\\-to\\-haves|    Preferred conditions|    Luxury brand experience, SAP knowledge|\n\n2. **Specify output requirements**\n\n    - Languages: Italian \\+ English\n\n    - Channel formats: LinkedIn / Indeed / Glassdoor / Company website\n\n    - Special requirements: Exclude discriminatory language, generate formal and social\\-media versions\n\n3. **AI generates the JDs**\nThe AI creates multiple versions based on your input\\.\n\n4. **Review and write to the multidimensional table**\nAfter confirming, the AI writes the JDs to the table for easy management and publishing\\.\n\n\n### Task Instruction\n\n```text\nGenerate Italian + English JDs for the following role:\n- Role: Senior Merchandiser\n- Level: Senior\n- Core responsibilities: Merchandise planning, SKU four-quadrant analysis, seasonal buying plan development\n- Requirements: 5+ years fashion industry, fluent Italian and English, proficient in data analysis tools\n- Nice-to-haves: Luxury brand experience, SAP knowledge\n\nOutput requirements:\n1. Adapt for LinkedIn / Indeed / Glassdoor / Company website — four channel formats\n2. Exclude discriminatory language (age/gender/race/religion/marital status, compliant with EU Anti-Discrimination Directive 2000/78/EC)\n3. Generate formal and social-media short versions\n4. Write all versions to the multidimensional table\n```\n\n\n### Expected Results\n\n- 2 languages × 4 channels \\(LinkedIn / Indeed / Glassdoor / Website\\) × 2 versions = **16 JDs**\n\n- All written to the multidimensional table, organized by channel and language\n\n- Ready to copy and publish directly from the table\n\n> PS: When generating JDs for multiple roles at once, start with one role, confirm quality, then batch the rest\\. Batch results are written to the same table\\.\n> \n> \n\n"
