        "title": "Sub-scenario A: Customer Profile & Lead Automation — From Business Card Photo to Follow-up Suggestions",
        "image": null,
        "markdown": "\n\n### Pain Point\n\n> \"Collect a stack of business cards at the trade show\\. By the time I organize them at home, leads are cold\\. Customer background research is manual\\. No context for follow\\-up\\.\"\n> \n> \n\n\n### What Makes This Valuable\n\nSnap a business card photo at the trade show → upload → AI parses and writes to the table → auto\\-researches customer background \\(Google Maps / LinkedIn / Instagram / website\\) → AI gives partnership recommendations\\. From lead capture to follow\\-up, all in one step\\. Leads don't go cold\\.\n\n\n### Steps\n\n1. **Snap and upload the business card**\nAt the trade show, snap a photo and upload it to the Workbench conversation\\.\n\n2. **AI auto\\-OCR \\+ write to table**\nThe AI auto\\-recognizes the card info:\n\n    |    Field|    Description|\n    |---|---|\n    |    Company|    Company name on the card|\n    |    Contact|    Name|\n    |    Title|    Job title|\n    |    Phone|    Contact number|\n    |    Email|    Email address|\n    |    Address|    Company address|\n\n3. **AI auto\\-researches customer background**\nThe AI automatically researches from multiple channels and creates a complete profile:\n\n    |    Channel|    Research content|\n    |---|---|\n    |    Google Maps|    Location, business status, rating, review count|\n    |    LinkedIn|    Company size, industry, recent updates, key decision\\-makers|\n    |    Instagram|    Follower count, partner brands, content style, recent activity|\n    |    Website|    Main business, target customer segment, price range|\n\n4. **AI gives partnership recommendations**\nYou input your follow\\-up rules\\. The AI gives recommendations based on the customer profile:\n\n    |    Recommendation dimension|    Description|\n    |---|---|\n    |    Match score|    High / Medium / Low|\n    |    Partnership approach|    Wholesale / Retail / E\\-commerce|\n    |    First\\-contact talking points|    Based on the customer's recent activity|\n    |    Recommended products|    Based on the customer's segment and price range|\n\n5. **Set follow\\-up reminders**\nLeads not followed up within 7 days are auto\\-flagged and pushed to Teams\\.\n\n\n### Task Instruction\n\n```\nRecognize this business card's information (Company / Contact Person / Title / Phone / Email / Address), write to multi-dimensional table customer lead tracker, set next follow-up date to 3 days later.\n\nThen research this customer's background information:\n1. Google Maps: company location, business status, rating and reviews\n2. LinkedIn: company size, industry, recent updates\n3. Instagram: follower count, partner brands, content style\n4. Official website: main business, target customer segment, price range\n\nSummarize and write to multi-dimensional table customer profile.\n\nBased on the customer profile and my follow-up rules (target customer = chain store + monthly sales 500+ + has Instagram operations), provide partnership advancement recommendations:\n1. Match score\n2. Recommended partnership approach (wholesale / retail / e-commerce)\n3. Suggested first-contact talking points (based on customer's recent activities)\n4. Recommended products (based on customer's segment and price range)\n\nSet reminder: leads not followed up within 7 days auto-flagged in red and pushed to Teams.\n```\n\n\n### Expected Results\n\n- Business card photo → structured lead in seconds\n\n- AI auto\\-researches 4 channels, generates a complete customer profile\n\n- AI gives partnership recommendations based on your rules\n\n- Follow\\-up status auto\\-monitored — leads don't go cold\n\n\n### Advanced: Batch Process All Trade Show Business Cards\n\nCollected 50 business cards at the trade show? Snap all photos, upload in batch\\. The AI processes: recognize → research → score → rank by match\\. You start following up with high\\-match leads by the time you get to the hotel\\.\n\n> PS: Personal information on business cards is \"personal data\" under GDPR\\. Ensure: 1\\) You obtained consent when collecting the card for business contact purposes; 2\\) Card data is used only for B2B business follow\\-up; 3\\) Delete unconverted lead data after a reasonable retention period \\(recommend 12 months\\)\\.\n> \n> \n\n"
